  "title": "Winter Lentil Vegetable Soup",
  "description": "This soup has very little fat, is cheap and easy to make and delicious. Our family practically lives on it in the winter and I usually double the recipe. Sprinkle grated cheddar on top if you wish. If you can&#39;t hang around long enough for this to cook, put it in a slow cooker.",
